# Monthly reports

Follow `.cursor/skills/monthly-reports/SKILL.md`. Primary output is `SEO/monthly-reports/YYYY-MM-client.md` + `YYYY-MM-Report.pdf`.

- Copy last month’s client HTML; keep `pdf-style.css` classes.
- Plain language, British English, ~6–8 pages. Insight after every data section.
- Do not invent GSC/GA4/AEO numbers. No Looker URL in client files.
- Sitemap: `bash SEO/sitemap-baseline/compare.sh YYYY-MM`
- Internal asks go in `YYYY-MM-todos.md`, not the PDF.
- Position: lower is better → show the number, e.g. green `−4.6% (better)`, red `+3.1% (worse)`. Not a bare “Improved”.
- Cover photo: a different one every month from `SEO/monthly-reports/assets/covers/` (log in its `README.md`).
- Build PDF with `npx md-to-pdf` + `pdf-style.css` (see skill / `SEO/monthly-reports/README.md`).
